	)
	(text "Crystal: 14.31818 MHz at its 20 pF load (LCSC C34748 class), model XTAL14 in models.lib."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 30.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1cc66452-6f07-593e-abeb-ddbbe47b4eed")
	)
	(text "The crystal sits between the base and node xs2. Two Schottky diodes clamp xs2 at about +-0.33 V, so the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 32.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "06630991-3aea-58a5-b15f-2de8ebb5b956")
	)
	(text "amplitude and the power in the crystal do not depend on the crystal's resistance or on the transistor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 35.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55fa84b4-4b32-5171-ac8d-501efcd54822")
	)
	(text "Cd2 and Cl2 divide that down to the level the mixer wants (more LO only leaks more into the second IF)."
